          "caption": "Cave at Kynance Cove. Looking out of this cave towards the northwest, one of the headlands protruding from Kynance Cliff is visible on the right (The Rill?). This cave is actually an arch, with a tall wide opening to the NW and a much smaller exit to the SE (behind the photographer). These caves are only accessible when the tide is out!",
